{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"options\": [\n    {\n      \"items\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"那点喜欢留得久了，他开始想象与那人安静相处；光这样想着，心里就很暖。\",\n          \"key\": \"想象中的亲近也让他快乐\",\n          \"follows\": false\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"这份自在让他一时想多说些心意，又怕把喜欢看得太重；他轻轻收住，心里有点酸，也仍旧欢喜。\",\n          \"key\": \"想说又收住，仍觉欢喜\",\n          \"follows\": true\n        }\n      ],\n      \"because\": [\n        {\n          \"item\": 1,\n          \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n          \"rel\": \"提供理由\",\n          \"why\": \"他先前舍不得让那点喜欢散去，心里便逐渐容得下更具体的相处想象，也开始尝到其中的快乐。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"item\": 2,\n          \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n          \"rel\": \"限制\",\n          \"why\": \"先前怕把一点喜欢看得过重，使他即使高兴得想多表达一些，也会把话收住。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"center_relation\": \"正在面对\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他体验到，想象与那人亲近也能带来真切的快乐。\",\n        \"他曾想多表达一点喜欢，却因为顾虑而收住。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 8,\n      \"why\": \"从模糊心动到享受心里的亲近，再到热切而有所保留，能够解释这段的亲密、轻松、微酸及短暂舒展。\",\n      \"uses\": [\"候选2\", \"候选3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"items\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"原先舍不得的是一个模糊念头，如今想象与那人相处的片刻也叫他留恋；想到它会过去，心里发酸。\",\n          \"key\": \"开始舍不得相处的片刻\",\n          \"follows\": false\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"他一时竟想，往后也能与那人这样静静待着该多好；又怕把喜欢想得太远，热意便渐渐收住。\",\n          \"key\": \"盼着以后也能如此\",\n          \"follows\": true\n        }\n      ],\n      \"because\": [\n        {\n          \"item\": 1,\n          \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n          \"rel\": \"提供理由\",\n          \"why\": \"先前他只想让那个喜欢的念头多停留，现在念头已经能带来具体的亲近感，舍不得的便成了这种感觉终究会消散。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"item\": 2,\n          \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n          \"rel\": \"限制\",\n          \"why\": \"先前怕过早看重这份喜欢，使他在短暂想到以后也能这样相处时，又不敢把想象延伸得太远。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"center_relation\": \"正在面对\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他开始为想象中的亲近终会消散而感到不舍。\",\n        \"他曾短暂盼望往后也能这样相处，又因怕过早看重而收住。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 8,\n      \"why\": \"这一路径把先前舍不得一个念头推进为舍不得亲近的片刻，尤其能解释持续流逝中的甜与酸，以及短暂升起又放轻的期待。\",\n      \"uses\": [\"候选7\", \"候选13\", \"候选16\"]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3b7e9991-e55e-4fd8-87ca-31d1403be89a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T151611372770Z", "elapsed_seconds": 617.281, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T15:26:28.658661+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5aac637b26ea7fa37f2cafd79b9d0c2f27c034d75485445a138887fd2653c289", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T151611372770Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "aadde957b5e4204fc2f90cb8e68ff07a98ef5b7f98841c51265c2aa5e557d607"}}}
